<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The first task was to design and optimize a Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\) for multi-class classification using a publicly available dataset. We had to experiment with architecture changes, hyperparameters, and data augmentation. Evaluation of the the model using metrics like accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score was to be shown, while documenting all steps, challenges, and insights.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
