/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (LSTMs come to the rescue to solve the vanishing gradient problem. It does so by ignoring \(forgetting\) useless data/information in the network. The LSTM will forget the data if there is no useful information from other inputs \(prior sentence words\). When new information comes, the network determines which information to be overlooked and which to be remembered. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
