/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Cell State is the long term memory. The forget gate decides what fraction of this long term memory should be remembered and what should be forgotten. There are no weights on the long term memory so as to remove the vanishing gradient problems.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
